  "instance_name": "mapping_feminism_to_protest_scene",
  "label": "feminism is mapped onto the protest scene",
  "description": "The text 'feminism:' at the top of the image is juxtaposed with the visual of a protest scene featuring women holding signs advocating for reproductive rights. This creates an analogical mapping where the broad social movement of feminism is visually represented by the protest scene, even though the protest itself is specifically about reproductive rights, which is a subset of feminist issues. The mapping is established by the direct textual label 'feminism:' placed over the image of the protest.",
